*.css

why: seed documents are JSON, which cannot carry a citation; seeds.test.ts and scripts/tune-seeds.mjs pin the rules they follow ([[C89]] standoffsSolveLast: groups liberally, standoffs sparingly)
src/graph/seedGraphs
